=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** Drawing your weapon will immediately start the battle, regardless of your distance to the target.
* Examine the **Ominous Postern** in {z:Ra'Kaznar Turris} to enter the fight against {m:Hades (Second Form)}.
* You will be assisted by {p:Arciela} and {m:Teodor}. The Mission will fail if either die.
** You can only cure {p:Arciela}.
** You can do no actions to {m:Teodor}. As such it is advantageous to not allow Hades to attack him as much as possible.
** Hades' HP bar is hidden throughout the entire fight.
* After winning, you will be thrown into another cutscene.
** Following the cutscene, you will be back in {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds}.

See {p:Discussion|Talk:Seekers of Adoulin Mission 5-4-1} for strategies.
=2 Notes
* Should you lose the battle, re-zone into {z:Ra'Kaznar Inner Court} for another {@k} {k:Awakened crystallized psyche}.

